The potentiometer reads 600. About what is the PWM duty cycle on D6?

```
int okuma = 600;
int hiz = okuma / 4;
analogWrite(6, hiz);
```

The motor speed should be set with the pot, but the motor is already at full speed before the pot reaches the middle. Which line is wrong?

```
const int MOTOR = 6;
void setup() { pinMode(MOTOR, OUTPUT); }

void loop() {
  int okuma = analogRead(A0);
  int hiz = okuma * 4;
  analogWrite(MOTOR, hiz);
  delay(10);
}
```
